{#- Tooltip({ text, side: top|bottom, focusable, id (of the description, with focusable) }) caller = the trigger — a short label shown on hover and keyboard focus. The trigger must take focus;
    for one that doesn't (a StatusDot, a Badge) set focusable: a wrapper takes focus, and the text is its description even without a script. -#}
{% macro Tooltip(p) -%}
  {%- set __html %}{% include "./template.njk" %}{% endset -%}
  {{- __html | trim | safe -}}
{%- endmacro %}
